  "properties": {
    "title": "Dynamic Tiling: From Cloud Optimized Raster to Map tiles",
    "description": "Over the recent years, Cloud Optimized Raster format have gain popularity not only because they ease access but also because the enable fast visualisation of the data. During this talk I'll go over the principles of dynamic tiling and talk about the different cloud optimized raster format. I'll also present the latest news about TiTiler.",
